{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113512","id":3067785011,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc622q8z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113512.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113512","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113512/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113512/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113512/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/10c7cb878aaf3fc7441405db8183fa5f390f10f8","number":113512,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add new monospace related hint strings","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR introduces a huge quality of life improvement in terms of editing text that is supposed to be read with a monospaced font.\r\n\r\n- Add hint string `monospace` for `PROPERTY_HINT_{NONE,PASSWORD,PLACEHOLDER_TEXT}` to set the `LineEdit` font monospaced.\r\n- Add hint string `monospace` for `PROPERTY_HINT_MULTILINE_TEXT` to set the `TextEdit` font monospaced.\r\n- Add hint string `no_wrap` for `PROPERTY_HINT_MULTILINE_TEXT` to make the `TextEdit` not wrap lines automatically.\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n- Fix issue with `EditorPropertyMultilineText` not updating font properly.\r\n- Add `EditorPropertyMultilineText` tweak flags.\r\n- Add support with GDScript `@export_multiline`.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| :---: | :---: |\r\n| <img width=\"644\" height=\"306\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 09 56 26\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef4c851c-0e03-4b46-83e7-92367292adf0\" /> | <img width=\"1288\" height=\"544\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca9f9355-a9c1-4492-91c0-039df96ab21e\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1178\" height=\"355\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 10 18 58\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/759312c1-5d68-4a0c-b8ff-db6855df9fda\" /> | <img width=\"1197\" height=\"328\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 11 26 33\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d851c56a-0909-4abc-90cd-1d470c367d81\" /><br><em>Please note <span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><code>\"nowrap\"</code></span> has been changed to <span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><code>\"no_wrap\"</code></span>.</em> |\r\n| <img width=\"871\" height=\"230\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 11 21 50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7de5179c-b72f-4370-9bc6-7e1f959dbe95\" /> | <img width=\"900\" height=\"289\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-12-03 à 11 06 35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61d7705b-04a9-40e8-b643-2d732c0c6761\" /> |\r\n\r\nI took a look at which properties of the export plugins would benefit from monospaced text, and I added the new hint string on them.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAlso, this PR:\r\n\r\n- Fixes issue with `EditorPropertyMultilineText` not updating font properly.\r\n- ~~Adds `EditorPropertyMultilineText` tweak flags.~~\r\n- Adds support with GDScript `@export_multiline`.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> I didn't update `@export` as it may require a little bit more thinking than exposing `hints` to `@export_multiline`.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic